        {
          "score": {
            "name": "@s",
            "objective": "tv_m_subs"
          },
          "color": "#FFD54F"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n미정산 후원금 "
        },
        {
          "score": {
            "name": "@s",
            "objective": "tv_m_pending"
          },
          "color": "#FFD54F"
        },
        {
          "text": "  (정산하면 "
        },
        {
          "score": {
            "name": "@s",
            "objective": "tv_m_net"
          },
          "color": "#FFD54F"
        },
        {
          "text": " 입금, 수수료 "
        },
        {
          "score": {
            "name": "@s",
            "objective": "tv_m_fee"
          },
          "color": "#FFD54F"
